POTION 10 8 "pickup.gatehouse.potion-1"
POTION 6 9 "pickup.gatehouse.potion-2"
ENEMIES 3
10 2 18 "enemy.prowler" "enemy.gatehouse.prowler-1"
11 8 24 "enemy.prowler" "enemy.gatehouse.prowler-2"
6 13 30 "enemy.brute" "enemy.gatehouse.brute-1"
SURFACE_OVERRIDES 10
4 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-vines"
3 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-root-trace"
7 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.portal.stone-arch-doorway"
10 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-soft-lichen"
11 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-lichen"
12 3 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-soft-lichen"
7 5 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.portal.iron-gatehouse-surround"
4 12 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-damp-moss"
4 13 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-wet"
5 13 WALL MATERIAL "material.wall.cave.mossy-rock-wet"
LIGHTS 4
3 3 "light.torch.iron-sconce"
7 6 "light.torch.iron-sconce"
2 10 "light.torch.tallow-candle"
10 13 "light.torch.pitch-brazier"
WATER 0
DOORS 1
"door.gatehouse.main-lock" 7 4 DOOR 1
OBJECTS 6
"note.gatehouse.watch-order" NOTE 3 2 0 "Watch Order" "Third bell: keep the lower gate barred. Something below has learned our knocking code." 0 0 "" ""
"shrine.gatehouse.veil" SHRINE 3 10 0 "Veil Shrine" "The worn stone is warm beneath your hand, though no flame burns here." 0 0 "" ""
"corpse.gatehouse.jailer" CORPSE 12 7 0 "The Jailer" "The corpse still grips an empty key ring. The final key was taken deeper in." 0 0 "" ""
"npc.gatehouse.wounded-scout" NPC 12 12 0 "Wounded Scout" "Do not trust the quiet beyond the iron gate. The quiet is how it hunts." 0 0 "" ""
"arrival.gatehouse.lower-gate" ARRIVAL_POINT 13 12 0 "Lower Gate Arrival" "Return from the Underkeep." 0 3 "" ""
"transition.gatehouse.descent" LEVEL_TRANSITION 13 13 0 "Descend to the Underkeep" "Cold air rises from the stair beneath the gate." 0 0 "underkeep.level-1" "arrival.underkeep.upper-stair"
ROOMS 4
"room.gatehouse.entry" 1 1 6 5 "The Abandoned Watch" "Teach observation, keys, and the first choice of route." "Stale vigilance" "The garrison expected an attack from outside. The danger came from below." "Unease and curiosity"
"room.gatehouse.lock" 8 1 7 6 "The Sealed Watch Hall" "Make the first locked threshold feel consequential." "Held breath" "The main lock was turned after the last watch failed to answer." "Commitment"
"room.gatehouse.crossing" 1 7 13 3 "The Broken Crossing" "Reveal the hidden route and the cost of haste." "Exposed" "Boot marks split here: soldiers to the gate, one barefoot trail into stone." "Suspicion"
"room.gatehouse.lower" 1 10 14 5 "The Lower Gate" "Deliver the level's warning and point toward the descent." "Cold anticipation" "Those who survived the first breach refused to speak its name." "Dread with forward pull"
TRIGGERS 6
"trigger.gatehouse.arrival" ENTER_ROOM 1 1 "room.gatehouse.entry" 1 "The watch hall smells of wet ash. Someone abandoned it in the middle of a shift."
"trigger.gatehouse.key" PICKUP_ITEM 5 2 "pickup.gatehouse.key-1" 1 "An iron key bears fresh scratches around its teeth. It was used in panic."
"trigger.gatehouse.door" OPEN_DOOR 7 4 "door.gatehouse.main-lock" 1 "The lock opens on a breath of colder air from the sealed hall."
"trigger.gatehouse.first-kill" KILL_ENEMY 10 2 "enemy.gatehouse.prowler-1" 1 "The prowler falls wearing a strip of Gatehouse uniform around one wrist."
"trigger.gatehouse.watch-order" INTERACT_OBJECT 3 2 "note.gatehouse.watch-order" 1 "Third bell: keep the lower gate barred. Something below has learned our knocking code."
"trigger.gatehouse.lower-warning" ENTER_ROOM 1 10 "room.gatehouse.lower" 1 "The lower stones hum faintly. The dungeon is no longer merely abandoned; it is listening."
END
